    "/jobs/{job_id}/export.xlsx": {
      "get": {
        "description": "Download a multi-sheet .xlsx for one job.\n\nRound 24: the user requested an Excel export that captures\nALL data (Round 23 CSV is one sheet; this endpoint produces\n5 sheets \u2014 panels, geology_contexts, localities,\npaleo_coordinates, legend). The endpoint streams the bytes\nvia ``StreamingResponse`` so a 10\u2075-row workbook doesn't\nblock the worker thread.\n\nSheets are produced by ``rlpe.exporters.xlsx.write_xlsx``\nwhich already sanitises formula-injection (CWE-1236) and\nuses ``openpyxl`` (transitive via the install env at\nversion 3.1.5).\n\naudit 2026-08-17 (WEB-B5): the optional ``paper_ids`` /\n``species`` / ``panel_ids`` / ``search`` query parameters\nrow-filter the panels sheet so the .xlsx download can mirror\nthe operator's UI filter (without these, the export always\nproduced the full job and silently disagreed with the\nvisible table). Each list param is comma-separated; values\nare matched case-insensitively. ``search`` does a substring\nmatch across paper_id, species, panel_id, figure_id and the\nfirst geology-link's formation/locality/country/age/lithology.",
        "operationId": "export_job_xlsx_jobs__job_id__export_xlsx_get",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "in": "path",
            "name": "job_id",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "title": "Job Id",
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          {
            "in": "query",
            "name": "paper_ids",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "type": "null"
                }
              ],
              "title": "Paper Ids"
            }
          },
          {
            "in": "query",
            "name": "species",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "type": "null"
                }
              ],
              "title": "Species"
            }
          },
          {
            "in": "query",
            "name": "panel_ids",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "type": "null"
                }
              ],
              "title": "Panel Ids"
            }
          },
          {
            "in": "query",
            "name": "search",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "type": "null"
                }
              ],
              "title": "Search"
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {}
              }
            },
            "description": "Successful Response"
          },
